                                                "sense_id": "ef7d3d8d-c724-38f7-bb7b-56dbeab2d58e",
                                                "text": "Not indeed for the sake of the Tract itself, which we admire little ; but of the marginal Notes, evidently in Teufelsdröckh's hand, which rather copiously fringe it."
                                            }
                                        ]
